WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.725
Rosters ready? Tap "Coin toss".

2
00:00:05.775 --> 00:00:08.362
Put each team on its side: "Switch sides".

3
00:00:08.412 --> 00:00:12.962
The ball marks the first serve: "Switch serve" moves it.

4
00:00:13.012 --> 00:00:18.517
Coach and captain of each team sign: "Sign A" → "Coach".

5
00:00:18.567 --> 00:00:21.926
Sign, then "Save".

6
00:00:21.976 --> 00:00:27.509
Then the captain.

7
00:00:27.559 --> 00:00:32.558
All four signed: "Confirm coin toss result".

8
00:00:32.608 --> 00:00:34.648
The starting line-ups: tap "Lineup A".

9
00:00:34.698 --> 00:00:41.698
Tap the players in order, position I (the server) first, then "Confirm".

10
00:00:44.825 --> 00:00:48.343
The captain is not on court: tap the "Game captain".

11
00:00:48.393 --> 00:00:55.393
The same for team B.

12
00:00:58.537 --> 00:01:00.250
Tap "Start set".

13
00:01:00.300 --> 00:01:03.851
A reminder: put the libero in if the team has one.

14
00:01:03.901 --> 00:01:06.954
Confirm the start time of the set.

15
00:01:07.004 --> 00:01:10.087
Set 1 is running.
